{
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-23",
  "description": "Pre-Ship Human Review Panel section template — defines standard review sections.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "## 0. Decision Summary (Must be actionable from these 6 lines alone)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "field_list",
          "fields": [
            {
              "label": "What",
              "key": "summaryWhat"
            },
            {
              "label": "Verification Evidence",
              "key": "summaryVerify"
            },
            {
              "label": "Risk / Rollback",
              "key": "summaryRisk"
            },
            {
              "label": "Quality Gate",
              "key": "qualityGate"
            },
            {
              "label": "Open Items",
              "key": "summaryOpenItems"
            },
            {
              "label": "Ask",
              "key": "summaryAsk"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "## 1. Approval Request",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "static",
          "lines": [
            "The following worktree work is complete.",
            "Please review the details and approve whether to proceed with merge / cleanup.",
            "Please select:",
            "- Approve and proceed",
            "- Revision required",
            "- Abort"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "## 2. Scope Fidelity (Request ↔ Interpretation ↔ Result)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "static",
          "lines": [
            "- Raw request (verbatim, not paraphrased):",
            "- AI interpretation (goal / scope / assumptions — task-interpretation.mjs record):",
            "- Delivered (what actually landed):",
            "- Gap verdict: match | drift (built something else) | creep (built more than asked) | narrowing (asked but missing)",
            "- Deliberately NOT done, and why (negative space a diff cannot show):"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "## 3. Review Attention Budget (Where a human should spend eyes first)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "static",
          "lines": [
            "- Read first (max 3, file:line + why it decides approval):",
            "- Lowest-confidence spot (AI self-assessed) + what would settle it:",
            "- If this breaks in production, it breaks here first:",
            "- Changed but covered by neither a test nor a human read:"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "## 4. Status Summary",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "field_list",
          "fields": [
            {
              "label": "Worktree path",
              "key": "worktreePath"
            },
            {
              "label": "Branch",
              "key": "branch"
            },
            {
              "label": "Base branch",
              "key": "baseBranch"
            },
            {
              "label": "PLAN.md",
              "key": "planPath"
            },
            {
              "label": "PLAN.md checklist",
              "key": "planChecklist"
            },
            {
              "label": "Worktree status",
              "key": "worktreeStatus"
            },
            {
              "label": "Quality Gate",
              "key": "qualityGate"
            },
            {
              "label": "Test / verify",
              "key": "testVerify"
            },
            {
              "label": "Draft PR",
              "key": "draftPr"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "## 5. Verification Evidence",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "table",
          "rows_key": "verificationRows",
          "header_lines": [
            " Command                            Result       What it proves",
            "━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━  ━━━━━━━━  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━"
          ],
          "row_template": " {command}    {result}    {proves}",
          "empty_rows": [
            {
              "command": "(collection required)",
              "result": "PASS/FAIL",
              "proves": "(what this run rules out)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "static",
          "lines": [
            "- New behavior covered by (test file:case):",
            "- Changed but not covered by any test, and why that is acceptable:"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "## 6. Worktree Commit Info",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "fenced_block",
          "content_key": "gitLog",
          "fallback": "<git log --oneline origin/main..HEAD>",
          "trim": true
        },
        {
          "type": "field_list",
          "fields": [
            {
              "label": "Commit count",
              "key": "commitCount"
            },
            {
              "label": "Commit range",
              "key": "commitRange"
            },
            {
              "label": "Latest commit",
              "key": "latestCommit"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "## 7. PR Draft",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "field_list",
          "fields": [
            {
              "label": "PR URL",
              "key": "prUrl"
            },
            {
              "label": "PR status",
              "key": "prStatus"
            },
            {
              "label": "Merge status",
              "key": "mergeStatus"
            },
            {
              "label": "CI status",
              "key": "ciStatus"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "## 8. Modified / Added Files",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "fenced_block",
          "content_key": "changedFilesTree",
          "fallback": "(collection required)",
          "trim": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "## 9. Change Details",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "table",
          "rows_key": "changedRows",
          "header_lines": [
            " Path               Type    Role    Reason for Change",
            "━━━━━━  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━  ━━━━━━  ━━━━━━━━━━"
          ],
          "row_template": " {path}    {kind}    Fill during review    Fill during review",
          "empty_rows": [
            {
              "path": "(collection required)",
              "kind": "NEW/EDIT/DELETE"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "## 10. Contract / Blast Radius (answer no, or yes → note)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "static",
          "lines": [
            "- SSOT registry touched (data/registry/**) → which derived views were regenerated:",
            "- Schema touched (data/schemas/**) → do existing artifacts still validate:",
            "- Hook registration touched (hook-registry.mjs) → was regen-hooks-settings.mjs run:",
            "- Exported / public interface changed → were all call sites updated:",
            "- Scaffold template touched (project-scaffolder/templates/**) → internal-rule boundary verdict:",
            "- Migration or backfill required → procedure:"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "## 11. Rationale for Modification",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "static",
          "lines": [
            "- Background:",
            "- Problem solved:",
            "- Approach adopted:",
            "- Alignment with user requirements:"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "## 12. Trade-offs",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "static",
          "lines": [
            "- Selected approach:",
            "- Alternative considered:",
            "- Rationale for selection:",
            "- Sacrifices made:",
            "- Conditions for future revisit:"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "## 13. Risks / Rollback",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "static",
          "lines": [
            "- Blast radius:",
            "- Known risks:",
            "- Unverified items:",
            "- Rollback procedure:"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "## 14. Remaining Work & Follow-ups (every item carries a priority)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "static",
          "lines": [
            "- P0 — must be resolved BEFORE this ship. Do not request approval while any P0 stands: none | <item>",
            "- P1 — follow-up PR required: none | <item> [resolution: <kind>:<target>]",
            "- P2 — backlog / optional: none | <item>",
            "- Registered as debt : <DEBT-ids> | not required (no P1/P2 items)",
            "- Handover for the next session:"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "## 15. Issues and Improvements Observed (every item carries a severity)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "static",
          "lines": [
            "- Severity scale: CRITICAL | HIGH | MEDIUM | LOW (same enum as followup-debt.schema.json#severity)",
            "- Issues encountered: none | <SEVERITY> <what happened> → <resolved how, or still open>",
            "- Improvement proposals: none | <SEVERITY> <proposal> → <where it belongs: rule | hook | script | doc>",
            "- Recurrence prevention: <mechanism added, file:line> | none (state why prompt-level suffices)"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
